  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Mobile App)\n\n### Capium 365 - Users (App)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 24 Apr, 2025 at 10:35 AM\n\n\t\tWelcome to our Guide for Users in Capium 365! This guide will walk you through essential initial steps, best practices and key features within Users. \n\nHow to set up users:\n\nNavigation: Click on the three dashes in the top right-hand corner of the screen > Navigate to “Users” Tab > Press on the “+” icon in the bottom right hand corner of the screen > Populate the user details as required > Press “Save”\n\nHow to invite users to Capium 365\n\nNavigation: Click on the three dashes in the top right hand corner of the screen > Navigate to “Users” Tab > Make sure the user has been added > On the right next to the user name there will be “Invite” > Click “Invite” > The user will then receive an email > Follow the steps and they will get their own unique log in\n\nDeleting a user\n\nNavigation: Click on the three dashes in the top right hand corner of the screen, Navigate to “Users” Tab, Hold down on the user you want to delete until it turns purple > Click the 3 dots in the top right > Click “Delete”\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000200746\">Capium 365 (Mobile App)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Capium 365 - Users (App)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 24 Apr, 2025 at 10:35 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 222.22222222222223%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/0f1cba2fd1264053a4beda6016a099e8?sid=700d69e5-777a-4a3d-b707-3492c7ccac4c\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">Welcome to our Guide for Users in Capium 365! This guide will walk you through essential initial steps, best practices and key features within Users.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>How to set up users</strong>:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Navigation:&nbsp;</strong>Click on the three dashes in the top right-hand corner of the screen &gt; Navigate to “Users” Tab &gt; Press on the “+” icon in the bottom right hand corner of the screen<strong>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;</strong>Populate the user details as required <strong>&gt;&nbsp;</strong>Press “Save”</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"68\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9230120980/original/zCketPlwYUgQd0C5xJHoGdW2Y3df8ww0FA.png?1745487277\" align=\"left\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9230120980\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong><u><span>&nbsp;</span></u></strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong><u><span>&nbsp;</span></u></strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>How to invite users to Capium 365</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Navigation:&nbsp;</strong>Click on the three dashes in the top right hand corner of the screen &gt; Navigate to “Users” Tab&nbsp;&gt; Make sure the user has been added &gt; On the right next to the user name there will be “Invite” &gt; Click “Invite” &gt; The user will then receive an email &gt; Follow the steps and they will get their own unique log in</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Deleting a user</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><strong>Navigation:&nbsp;</strong>Click on the three dashes in the top right hand corner of the screen, Navigate to “Users” Tab, Hold down on the user you want to delete until it turns purple &gt; Click the 3 dots in the top right &gt; Click “Delete”</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><img width=\"112\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9230120981/original/nOib5xCgjfoldtAwIURY9sLaLR9Ny9aNiw.png?1745487277\" align=\"left\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9230120981\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 115%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000246972\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful